---
Add smooth playhead animation in drum grid.

Show a vertical line or highlight that moves across the drum grid
in sync with playback position.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Playhead line visible during playback
- [ ] Position interpolated between steps for smooth movement
- [ ] Playhead color contrasts with grid background
- [ ] Playhead stops/resets when playback stops
- [ ] Works in both pattern and song mode

## Test Plan
- [ ] Start playback, verify playhead moves smoothly
- [ ] Stop playback, verify playhead stops
- [ ] Change BPM, verify playhead speed changes accordingly
